[End thinking]

```python
def is_palindrome(word):
    """
    Return True if `word` reads the same forwards and backwards,
    ignoring case; otherwise return False.
    """
    # Example: is_palindrome("RaceCar")  # True
    return word.lower() == word.lower()[::-1]
```

